  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building democratic, peaceful and gender equal society in Ukraine II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of the project is as follows: Women will meaningfully participate in, and equally benefit from, peace and security processes at all levels in Ukraine. The project will build capacities of women&apos;s organizations to meaningfully participate in conflict prevention and recovery at all levels. The project will improve economic conditions and gaps in services.
Build capacity of government institutions at all levels to implement and monitor WPS commitments in sustainable and inclusive ways.</narrative>
  </description>
